speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, may I direct a question to the Minister of Veterans Affairs. In view of the unanimous decision reached by the House on November 9 asking the minister to give urgent consideration to possible changes with respect to the Veterans Land Act so that veterans applying for loans, even if mainly for the purpose of solving their housing needs, might get assistance, may I ask the hon. gentleman whether he has completed this consideration and whether he is yet in a position to report thereon to the House?
Hon, Daniel J. MacDonald (Minister of Veterans Affairs): No, Mr. Speaker, I have not yet completed my consideration of this matter.
[Mr. McGrath.}
